{"ref":"BDB, שָׂבָע","hw":"שָׂבָע","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂבָע</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:29\" href=\"/Genesis.41.29\">Gn 41:29</a></sup> <strong>plenty, satiety</strong>;—only abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳</span>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>plenty</em>, of bread-stuffs <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:29\" href=\"/Genesis.41.29\">Gn 41:29</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:30\" href=\"/Genesis.41.30\">30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:31\" href=\"/Genesis.41.31\">31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:34\" href=\"/Genesis.41.34\">34</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:47\" href=\"/Genesis.41.47\">47</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:53\" href=\"/Genesis.41.53\">53</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.10\">Pr 3:10</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>satiety</em>, <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 5:11\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.5.11\">Ec 5:11</a>.","next":"BDB, שָׂבֵעַ²","prev":"BDB, שָׂבְעָה"}